    "description": "A dog park in Madrid becomes a meeting point for a diverse group of neighbors of different ages, interests, and perspectives, with completely disparate jobs, families, and pasts, who come together in this place because of one common bond: their love for dogs.\n\nThrough humor and irony, the series reflects the problems and obstacles of contemporary society through the interactions of these characters. The park becomes a microcosm where unlikely friendships, secret romances, and intense rivalries emerge, while the series humorously addresses current and relevant issues in Spanish society.",
